anges are accurate</li>\n\t<li>Collaborate with stakeholders to understand and document requirements;</li>\n\t<li>Support Client Services team with ongoing questions and development of training materials for end users;</li>\n\t<li>Contribute to the structure and design of solution components;</li>\n\t<li>Manage the project deliverables in a timely manner;</li>\n\t<li>Help build a user-friendly and high-quality software solution.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Benefits from 8allocate:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Team & Culture: Team events, offsites, and a culture that keeps people connected.</li>\n\t<li>Learning & Development: Budget for courses, certifications, and conferences.</li>\n\t<li>Wellbeing: Flexible support in line with company policy, with options to support your physical and mental wellbeing (sport, mental health, or medical insurance).</li>\n\t<li>Rest & Recovery: Paid vacation and sick leave.</li>\n</ul>\n","regionGroupSelected":false,"languages":[{"name":"english","level":"Upper_Intermediate"}],"orgName":"8allocate","accountInformation":{"companyPhone":"+3726104251","companyEmail":"info@8allocate.com","companyLocation":"{\"country\":\"Estonia\",\"city\":\"Tallinn\",\"street\":\"Peterburi TEE 47, Lasnamae district, 11415\"}","companyDescription":"<p><strong>8allocate</strong> is an AI solutions development company that helps businesses accelerate growth, streamline operations, and enhance decision-making.<br>\n<br>\nFounded in 2015 and headquartered in Tallinn, Estonia, with R&D centers across Central and Eastern Europe (Poland, Ukraine, Romania) and Latin America, we empower organizations in FinTech, EdTech, Construction Technology, and other high-growth industries.<br>\n<br>\nWe build AI-driven solutions that transform operations, unlock new efficiencies, and enable real-time decision-making. From automation and predictive analytics to Agentic AI and scalable cloud-based platforms, these solutions provide a strategic advantage by seamlessly inte